---
// src/components/Footer.astro
// Sasis Footer Kampus STIT YA'MAL - Versi Clean Light Mode, 100% Simetris & Center Sejajar Atas!
---
<footer style="margin-top: 80px; background-color: #f4f9fa; color: #374151; padding: 48px 20px; font-family: sans-serif; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; width: 100%; display: flex; justify-content: center; box-sizing: border-box;">
  <div style="width: 100%; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 40px; box-sizing: border-box;">
    
    <!-- KOLOM 1: IDENTITAS KAMPUS -->
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; box-sizing: border-box;">
      <h3 style="color: #005d6c; font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.3px;">
        STIT YA'MAL TANGERANG
      </h3>
      <p style="color: #4b5563; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; font-weight: 400;">
        Sekolah Tinggi Ilmu Tarbiyah (STIT) YA'MAL Tangerang. Menyelenggarakan Pendidikan Tinggi Islam Terpadu, Kuliah Fleksibel, Bermutu, dan Berakhlak Mulia.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- KOLOM 2: LOKASI KAMPUS + GOOGLE MAPS -->
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; box-sizing: border-box;">
      <h3 style="color: #005d6c; font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.3px;">
        📍 LOKASI KAMPUS
      </h3>
      <p style="color: #1f2937; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; font-weight: 500;">
        Kampus Perintis, Jl. Raya Kutabumi, Desa Karet, Kecamatan Sepatan, Kabupaten Tangerang 15520
      </p>
      <div style="margin-top: 4px;">
        <a 
          href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/STIT+Ya'mal+Tangerang/@-6.1536514,106.588053,19z/data=!4m10!1m2!2m1!1sstityamal.ac.id!3m6!1s0x2e69ff00506794f7:0xa7be9ecddb76ab60!8m2!3d-6.1536609!4d106.588693!15sCg9zdGl0eWFtYWwuYWMuaWRaESIPc3RpdHlhbWFsIGFjIGlkkgEHY29sbGVnZZoBI0NoWkRTVWhOTUc5blMwVkpRMEZuU1VRM2VVOURlRk5CRUFF4AEA-gEFCIYBEBE!16s%2Fg%2F11w9ybbzrz?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D" 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          style="text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; color: #005d6c; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; transition: color 0.15s;"
          onmouseover="this.style.color='#eab308'"
          onmouseout="this.style.color='#005d6c'"
        >
          🌐 Lihat Lokasi di Google Maps ➔
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- KOLOM 3: KONTAK & TAUTAN SITUS WEB -->
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; box-sizing: border-box;">
      <h3 style="color: #005d6c; font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.3px;">
        📞 HUBUNGI KAMI
      </h3>
      <div style="color: #4b5563; font-size: 0.88rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-weight: 500;">
        <p style="margin: 0; color: #4b5563;">🟢 Helpdesk 1 : <span style="color: #111827; font-weight: bold;">0831-5074-6849</span></p>
        <p style="margin: 0; color: #4b5563;">🟢 Helpdesk 2 : <span style="color: #111827; font-weight: bold;">0896-9366-6840</span></p>
        <p style="margin: 0; padding-top: 4px; color: #4b5563;">
          🌐 Situs Resmi : <a href="https://stityamal.ac.id" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #005d6c; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; text-decoration-color: #eab308; font-weight: bold; transition: color 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#eab308'" onmouseout="this.style.color='#005d6c'">www.stityamal.ac.id</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>

<div style="background-color: #f4f9fa; width: 100%; padding-bottom: 24px; text-align: center; color: #9ca3af; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; font-family: sans-serif;">
  Copyright © 2026 STIT YA'MAL Tangerang. All rights reserved.
</div>
